06. Create with ["urn:ngsi-ld:null"] as a valueList - the NGSI-LD Null has no meaning in a create - 400
=======================================================================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 236

{
  "detail": "'urn:ngsi-ld:null' is not allowed as the value of attribute 'https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/default-context/l'",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid Value",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



